</figure></div><div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_2">
<figure id="S7.F3.fig2" class="ltx_figure ltx_figure_panel ltx_minipage ltx_align_middle" style="width:169.1pt;">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering">(b) Tiny ImageNet</figcaption><object type="image/svg+xml" data="2602.20450v1/iqr_tiny_plot_20_smoothed.svg" id="S7.F3.g2" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:234/155;" width="234" height="155"></object>
</figure></div></div>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 3: </span>Accuracy of global model on varying quartiles.</figcaption>
</figure>
